  "content": "<h1>計分板調整</h1><p>針對 Minecraft 計分板/側邊欄的改進與自訂功能</p><h2>功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li>移除計分板</li>\n<li>移除除錯介面中的計分板</li>\n<li>計分板縮放比例</li>\n<li>移除分數顯示</li>\n<li>僅移除連續分數</li>\n<li>分數顏色</li>\n<li>標題顏色</li>\n<li>內文顏色</li>\n<li>標題陰影</li>\n<li>內文陰影</li>\n<li>分數陰影</li>\n<li>水平移動</li>\n<li>垂直移動</li>\n</ul><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmicrocontrollers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\">\n</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodeberg.org%252fMicrocontrollersDev%252fScoreboardTweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"codeberg\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/codeberg_vector.svg\">\n</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fscoreboardtweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">\n</a>",
